      "name": "infer_whu_checkpoint.sh",
      "filePath": "scripts/infer_whu_checkpoint.sh",
      "summary": "推理入口脚本：加载共享运行环境后，以指定的 checkpoint 路径及额外透传参数调用 inference/infer_from_checkpoint.py，在 WHU 数据集上执行推理。",
      "tags": ["entry-point", "inference", "shell-script", "checkpoint"],
      "complexity": "simple",
      "languageNotes": "启用 set -Eeuo pipefail 严格模式，并用 exec 将当前 shell 进程替换为 Python 推理进程，避免多余的中介进程。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:scripts/load_environment.sh",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "load_environment.sh",
      "filePath": "scripts/load_environment.sh",
      "summary": "供其他脚本 source 的共享环境加载器：优先加载机器本地的 configs/environment.local.sh，否则回退到 configs/environment.sh，也可通过 PORTABLE_SAM2_ENV_FILE 强制指定；随后校验 PYTHON、SAM2_REPO、WHU1024_DATA_ROOT、GPU 与训练超参等必需环境变量，缺失即报错返回。",
      "tags": ["utility", "environment", "configuration", "validation", "shell-script"],
      "complexity": "simple",
      "languageNotes": "利用 bash 间接变量展开 ${!_ENV_NAME:-} 遍历必需变量名数组完成环境校验，并在结束时 unset 全部临时变量，避免污染调用方 shell。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:scripts/run_whu1024_explicit_coarse_4gpu.sh",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "run_whu1024_explicit_coarse_4gpu.sh",
      "filePath": "scripts/run_whu1024_explicit_coarse_4gpu.sh",
      "summary": "WHU1024 显式粗粒度（explicit coarse）实验的 4 GPU 训练启动器：设置模型规模（base_plus）、提示模式、P2 边界精化开关、训练子集比例与 checkpoint 目录等默认超参，再按提示模式/精化开关/嵌入步幅的组合通过 case 分发到 scripts/ablations/ 下对应的消融包装脚本执行。",
      "tags": ["entry-point", "training", "shell-script", "ablation", "multi-gpu"],
      "complexity": "simple",
      "languageNotes": "使用 bash case 按 EXPLICIT_PROMPT_MODE:P2_BOUNDARY_REFINER_ENABLED:SAM_IMAGE_EMBED_STRIDE 三元组选择消融脚本，未匹配的组合直接报错退出（exit 2）。"
    },
    {
